_4232071023953588234_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zCpvkcEackcQ7kNvwGcH8G1&_nc_oc=Adn5TI42jw7bDQAg0kG7VTe8WbVvboVuX5umkC0yZGt-48P3y0M3VMtSy_WavKCxdSc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfwvIuuF_8hy63zNkoQURoXy9y-G1rapCo2ouCi4F4Kh8Q&oe=69AC2ABA"}, {"file_name": "1-2560x1440.png", "id": "999610461677141", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031311_999610465010474_1087177970663193150_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=E6giOKPxEJUQ7kNvwEY9uVm&_nc_oc=AdlypJVBT9P0rYBOQl8gGsStgfT0I1P0EYUAYuH8KM9OCFJW2B5vSgQYdXGghZEnlWM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfyNzcQiPx5qtAbwYaUFA9sOVDhz9pBxBs71fF21g-EM8A&oe=69AC34EB"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "2.png", "id": "427799910014327", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75254872_427799913347660_1009234490175775686_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=bN1bsQpHup4Q7kNvwHqIyww&_nc_oc=Adk0DD3Jxz-D9ubeUCtJ4buEjRUXg9YxIz9_VUBwhOErkImbqkz2Rna-S7dIGXOKvug&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfzAYH4sfr1wFS4Tw8J8eOW7QcXvqwAWEW43m8ZuBYSBvw&oe=69AC308F"}, "display_name": "Hamster Inc.", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Welcome to \"Hamster Inc.\"! It's a physics building game that supports \"mixed reality\". In this delightful puzzle game, you'll design, build, and then program machines to overcome challenges!\n\n# Creativity and Logic\n- Based on physical principles and logic, think about how to overcome obstacles and help hamsters improve transportation efficiency.\n{1557136708179895}\n\n# Assembling\n- Design and build a variety of machines with over 60 types of blocks.\n- Over 20 special-function blocks that can be programmed, such as ultrasonic sensors, DC motors, radars and more.\n{327773876776917}\n\n# Graphical programming\n- Super easy! Graphical programming makes your creations \"alive\"!\n{406792278927140}\n\n# Explore 6 unique themes\n- Explore Eastern Forests, Automated factories, Sunshine Coast, Western Gobi, Volcanic Tunnels, and Northern snowfields.\n- As you progress, develop your hamster company and unlock new resources and challenges.\n\n# Enjoy the sandbox mode\n- where you can build and program freely without any limitations on the block amount!\n{971212150879070}\n\n# Mixed Reality\nBring your creations into real world and transform the entire room into a dream paradise: \n- Create custom levels by using real furniture and virtual terrain models, \n- Have your car/drone automatically avoid furniture as it moves around the room,\n- Watch virtual creatures interact with real world: like bison running on tables, floors, or beds!\n{897586709048914}\n\nDiscord: https://discord.gg/NkC8bwQEmK\n", "short_description": "\"Hamster Inc.\" is a physics-based building game that supports \"mixed reality.\"\nIn the game, you can build a variety of interesting inventions such as trebuchets, unmanned trucks, robotic arms, and drones to help the hamsters overcome challenges one after another and continuously develop and expand the logistics territory."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "\u6d77\u62a52560x1440\u5907\u90097-2+logo-\u4e2d\u6587.png", "id": "3772762123041281", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/65229464_3772762126374614_5116127187365598796_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=9MZ9lPL5aq8Q7kNvwErcMk3&_nc_oc=Adn9DaCEDUYBYG8RHGO0K1oUJa58zMHtAoyHJpw6qHWV7xffR7-kPEJq5E3iy-n9OCw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfyVswAIjWn2mbjKKMRFyc6hoFdAai0FjqESR5-tIBts0g&oe=69AC2CD9"}, {"file_name": "icon2.png", "id": "1090290192036087", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57575357_1090290195369420_677972531973123807_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=MANOoLP95QoQ7kNvwGki6Nt&_nc_oc=Adn0vxMW3rzvMJ9rKYTdTx00Dmr_SChhYpn0adkAYWpN